{"lines":[{"y":0.0054608532215278949,"h":0.035589921439291849,"w":0.30406163533528646,"c":1,"t":"@MirsIELTS","x":0.0081334532790735166},{"c":1,"h":0.021003923444269712,"x":0.67927394072581793,"t":"Sample Writing answers","y":0.040171656459097704,"w":0.23279396057128898},{"c":1,"x":0.073648832502747813,"y":0.087380037962473622,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 1","h":0.024415057247015537,"w":0.35793960571289063},{"y":0.12603754629766672,"w":0.69210301717122402,"h":0.01856230170325901,"x":0.075904821227929103,"c":1,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.5 score."},{"c":1,"y":0.15315924031815908,"h":0.021615041322061046,"t":"The given diagram illustrates the various stages in the process of producing ethanol, a kind of biofuel.","x":0.071809344646826881,"w":0.8296839904785156},{"h":0.01892536129571698,"x":0.07392197214177533,"t":"Overall, there are about 9 main phrases in the ethanol production, starting with growing plants and","y":0.18313953537739891,"c":1,"w":0.82956878662109368},{"x":0.071782396168228318,"y":0.20240412942977615,"h":0.022027819698187456,"w":0.6510928344726562,"c":1,"t":"tress, and finishing with supplying ethanol for transportation and gas mission."},{"x":0.073921972086102225,"t":"At the first stage in the process of making ethanol, a large number of trees and plants are grown.","y":0.2309734512880508,"c":1,"w":0.82135523478190109,"h":0.020480037227844416},{"c":1,"x":0.071868584272936853,"w":0.83778233846028638,"h":0.018999965071326508,"y":0.2528023600090733,"t":"Thanks to the source of energy from sunlight and carbon dioxide from humman and transportattin,"},{"w":0.81331614176432288,"x":0.073843204756920022,"t":"plants and trees grow up and are haverested when they are mature enough. After being collected","y":0.27177601372819682,"h":0.022249877839665144,"c":1},{"y":0.29307797081031173,"w":0.83379135131835946,"h":0.021114446139265275,"c":1,"x":0.073859941465989232,"t":"by machine, they are put into another machine where slice them into small pieces to form cellulose."},{"t":"This step is call pre-processing.","y":0.31441194009914264,"x":0.073683992613993041,"h":0.020000793096941805,"c":1,"w":0.26742998758951819},{"t":"In the following stage, cellulose are taken to a factory where \"processing\" stage occurs.","x":0.073921979139862898,"w":0.72484598795572919,"h":0.023303834808259594,"y":0.33864306739111638,"c":1},{"y":0.36337209351599475,"h":0.018928791147417634,"x":0.073921964671984031,"c":1,"t":"Subsequently, Sugars are extracted from original cellulose before microbes are added to make","w":0.79466120402018237},{"c":1,"x":0.073921965520746841,"y":0.38372093072215552,"w":0.81930185953776047,"h":0.018933937050248262,"t":"ethanol. It is then used as a tupe of fuel for a lot of means of transportation such as cars, trucks,"},{"w":0.80903488159179693,"h":0.02041400920676617,"y":0.40406976703048425,"t":"airplanes. Finally, a huge amount of carbon dioxide which is released into the air become energy","x":0.073921988259543048,"c":1},{"w":0.42915812174479173,"c":1,"h":0.021872641414315996,"t":"for process of \"photosynthesis\" of plants and trees.","x":0.0739219656822028,"y":0.42296511657683089},{"w":0.31211499532063802,"h":0.015988371857499573,"c":1,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.075975357288346285,"y":0.46075581391136655},{"x":0.12114989535125252,"w":0.73921971638997397,"c":1,"t":"This is a strong response. The first short paragraph is an introduction, then the","h":0.017699115044247815,"y":0.49115044247245931},{"x":0.11909651311257666,"t":"second paragraph contains an overview of the process [starting with growing","c":1,"y":0.51002949848325752,"h":0.016224188790560423,"w":0.72484598795572919},{"x":0.12109744733182234,"w":0.77011906941731767,"c":1,"h":0.020394152525955223,"t":"plants] and [finishing with supplying ethano\/]. This is sufficient as an overview, but","y":0.52475890029534833},{"c":1,"x":0.11909650131856742,"y":0.54505813964887473,"w":0.75359344482421875,"h":0.016003807315432494,"t":"the candidate should also summarise the main stages. The rest of the response"},{"y":0.56395348847716564,"c":1,"t":"presents and highlights the process.","h":0.015988371857499573,"x":0.12114990178087538,"w":0.34291580200195315},{"c":1,"w":0.79260777791341142,"y":0.59292035418783029,"t":"Ideas are logically organised and the response follows the order given in the diagram.","x":0.11909652167277064,"h":0.016224188790560534},{"t":"There is good use of linking words to describe a process [At the first stage | After","w":0.74537989298502605,"y":0.61032448394321992,"h":0.017699115044247815,"c":1,"x":0.12114988913915738},{"h":0.0214369906085079,"c":1,"y":0.62681866728760194,"t":"being | Subsequently] and other linking devices, including reference and substitution","x":0.12107354443469007,"w":0.77429199218749989},{"t":"they | then used].","y":0.64825581406113109,"x":0.11909650825898713,"h":0.016050970589516766,"c":1,"w":0.17248460133870444},{"y":0.67581120933035965,"w":0.63860371907552083,"t":"The candidate uses vocabulary well with some flexibility [extracted |","x":0.12114988580808547,"h":0.01604925566366644,"c":1},{"w":0.77629948933919268,"y":0.69240798922854629,"x":0.11903933094557848,"h":0.01872567933569258,"c":1,"t":"photosynthesis], but there are a handful of errors [phrases \/ phases | tress \/ trees |"},{"t":"humman \/ human | transportattin \/ transportation | tupe \/ type]. These errors do not","w":0.78053120930989572,"h":0.02275978020862135,"c":1,"x":0.11897577739160331,"y":0.70798919500543545},{"x":0.11909651226592748,"w":0.28952771504720048,"c":1,"h":0.017546477641327884,"t":"get in the way of the meaning.","y":0.72965116259884366},{"x":0.12104762326379349,"c":1,"w":0.76818150838216148,"y":0.75629288447440091,"h":0.020570825897486822,"t":"Grammatical range is quite broad and there is a variety of complex structures and"},{"t":"sentences with multiple clauses. There are a few errors [where slice them \/ which","h":0.018973379219527797,"c":1,"w":0.76604161580403651,"y":0.77598051179312733,"x":0.12108523773622125},{"h":0.014817032490508031,"c":1,"t":"slices them].","x":0.1210214346197416,"y":0.79561587971203718,"w":0.12148890177408855},{"t":"To achieve a higher score, an overview which summarises the main stages should be","y":0.82276130007710735,"w":0.77019205729166673,"x":0.12106741438687209,"h":0.019654398330193334,"c":1},{"t":"presented, for example: This cycle for biofuel production involves three main stages:","x":0.12108167082029155,"y":0.84099218008445609,"w":0.75989507039388027,"c":1,"h":0.019700158943468771},{"c":1,"x":0.11909650208810159,"w":0.77823410034179674,"y":0.86046511630291955,"t":"harvesting and preparing plant material for processing, producing ethanol by chemical","h":0.017441860412777621},{"t":"processing, then using the fuel for transportation, before the cycle begins again.","h":0.017472730766003863,"w":0.71868581136067711,"c":1,"x":0.1211499073568091,"y":0.87787610641395786},{"x":0.87268993788118865,"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"133","y":0.91860465142285819},{"h":0.04166666666666663,"c":1,"x":0.51176470218665204,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.45294118245442705,"y":0.94166666659226195}],"w":2400,"h":3390}